<title>PAKISTAN: Port conditions update - Pakistan - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Pakistan - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>PAKISTAN, April 1 - Karachi - Vessels waiting off port, one sugar waiting one day. Two loaders, first waiting for five days. One oil tanker waiting three days. Six other vessels waiting off port for their own reasons.</p>
</text>
